👉 You can see execution logs

🧠 FINAL UNDERSTANDING (VERY IMPORTANT FOR EXAM)

Flow:

Upload file → S3 bucket
        ↓
S3 trigger → Lambda runs
        ↓
Lambda code executes
        ↓
Data stored in DynamoDB
💥 PRO TIP (EXAM GOLD LINE)

👉 This is called a Serverless Architecture using:

Amazon S3
AWS Lambda
Amazon DynamoDB
